    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lamina Bruise</i>\u00a0is an experimental first person adventure. It tells a surreal sci-fi story through strange yet recognizable organic interfaces, technologies and environments, without relying on text exposition. A singular experience, taking the player on a visual journey with minimal, playful interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860280/extras/9b34462295dfbac127c6795456dee231.avif?t=1754596507\" width=616 height=208 /></span></p>",
